        DISPOSITION BA GAP CLOSURE - TRANCHE 1 ONLY.
        Built 2026-08-31 for agent-output/disposition-gap-closure-t1-design.md.

        WHY THIS FILE EXISTS, AND WHY manifest/package.xml MUST NOT BE USED INSTEAD:
        manifest/package.xml is the FULL-ORG RETRIEVE manifest (82 type blocks). Deploying it -
        or a source-dir deploy of force-app, would sweep several OTHER concurrent streams'
        undeployed, unreviewed work into usman-dpeg. Confirmed non-Tranche-1 work present in this
        shared working tree at build time includes BrokerProtectionConfigSelector(+Test),
        Transaction__c.Tasks_Open__c, two Transactions reports, the
        Transaction_Stage_Closed_Sets_Status flow, Activity.Blocked_By__c /
        Is_Prerequisite_Met__c + Activity validationRules, ~6 seed scripts, and several
        session-start modifications (LLMExtractionCalloutService, BrokerProtectionConfig, three
        dashboards, six tabs, DPEG_Transaction_Edit/_View).

        SCOPE IS EXPLICIT AND CLOSED. Every member below was verified to exist on disk on
        2026-08-31. Nothing is wildcarded - a wildcard is what re-introduces the sweep.

        ONE MEMBER IS NOT A ONE-FILE DEPLOY:
        - CustomObjectTranslation Broker_Listing__c-en_US deploys the WHOLE translation folder
          (11 field translations), not just the new Days_On_Market_Live__c. The other 10 are
          pre-existing and unchanged, so this is expected - but it is not a single-field ship.

        PERMISSION SETS REPLACE, THEY DO NOT MERGE. All four sets below were reconciled against
        the live org by SOQL on 2026-08-31 (FieldPermissions / ObjectPermissions /
        SetupEntityAccess) and showed ZERO org-only grants. Re-run that reconciliation if this
        manifest is deployed later than that date - the org is being actively modified by other
        streams (a batch landed at 12:03-12:17 UTC on 2026-08-31).
    -->

